# Crash into the cycle's own trail, turn along it and run beside it 25 away (the closest
# collision allows): the trail beside should reach the screen edge, with nothing showing past it.
wait 17
press c 3
wait 2
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 0.5
press right
wait 1.5
press right
wait 1
shot side_run
keydown up
wait 0.4
shot side_boost
keyup up
wait 0.3
